damaged_code:
```cpp
struct Coords { int64_t x; int32_t y; };
volatile Coords global_coords;

// Thread 1
global_coords = { 10, 20 }; // Plain struct assignment

// Thread 2
Coords local = global_coords; // Can read a torn half-written value!
```

fix:
Protect the struct accesses with a Mutex.
```cpp
std::mutex coords_mutex;
// Thread 1
{
    std::lock_guard<std::mutex> lock(coords_mutex);
    global_coords = { 10, 20 };
}
```
